      "statement": "`rusty-app.service` is wanted by and ordered after `graphical-session.target` and after `rusty-mcp.service` (which it wants), stops with the session through `PartOf`, runs in `app-graphical.slice`, executes the binary itself as `rusty session run`, restarts two seconds after any exit except status 0, and logs under the identifier `rusty`.",
